m-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 36px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">价格也打下来了</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">那它这么牛，价格还不得贵上天？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">俗话说得好，卷天卷地卷对手，A社</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">狠起来连自己都不放过</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">！</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">前脚Kimi刚打响抢占国民性价比第一枪，A社二话不说，开团秒跟。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Opus 5拿着超越Fable 5的性能，价格却只到Fable 5的一半儿。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506167855\" data-ratio=\"1.0138888888888888\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_a6ff776.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">这下可把广大网民们乐坏了，Opus 5上线不过半天，网上已经玩嗨了。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 8px 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 36px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">网友们玩嗨了</span></span></h2>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">咱们来看看网友们都整出了什么花活。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一位国外博主只用了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">27%的5倍Max订阅额度</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，却搭出了他目前见过的、最好的一个 Rocket League克隆版。直呼 ：“</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">那些认为Opus 5只是个便宜版Fable的人，简直是大错特错！</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">”</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.1305555555555555\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506167856\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_57c742b.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这画面，这流畅度，确实没得说。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.6504065040650406\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"492\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"492\" data-backh=\"320\" data-imgfileid=\"506167861\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_4885c9d.gif\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">无独有偶，另一位博主在测完一个竞技场对决后，当场高喊</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">“这分明就是 Fable 6！Fable 5根本没法比</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">”。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8666666666666667\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1202\" data-height=\"1042\" data-imgfileid=\"506167857\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_42aaa66.png\"></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">据他所说，Opus 5直接打破了他原有的测试标准，交付成果让人根本不敢相信是靠代码生成。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.5633802816901409\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"568\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506167862\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_7b2db97.gif\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">类似的评价在网上层出不穷。现在测评大佬们对它的共识就四个字：“</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">是个怪物</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">”。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其实，Opus 5的恐怖</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">早有预兆</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">发布之初，官方随手甩出两个demo：一个是能实时显示气流路径的风洞模拟，气流怎么绕过去的看得一清二楚。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.5633802816901409\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"568\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506167863\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221105_ed4291d.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">另一个是一张能360度旋转的3D细胞结构图，连内质网上密密麻麻的核糖体都画得无比清晰。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.5633802816901409\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"568\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506167864\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_46f9c0b.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">物理+编程、生物+设计。要知道，这两个活随便拎一个出来，都不是单一专业人士靠自己就能做到的，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">至少也得靠一个团队的长期磨合</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">而现在，Opus 5</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">不仅兼备跨学科的专业知识和技能，还可以在几分钟内快速融合，一次性产出成果。</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">一个人就顶一支队伍</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，花上几个小时就能彻底搞定，真正的</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">把专业知识转变成拿来就用的工具，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这是过去任何一个单一职业的人都办不到的事。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Opus 5，真的是个魔鬼。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 8px 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 36px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">马斯克都来点赞了</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">更有意思的是，在Opus 5发布之后，马斯克也来蹭了波热闹。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他放了张性价比截图，表示</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">目前市面上的最优选只有Grok 4.5和Opus 5</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6685185185185185\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"722\" data-imgfileid=\"506167858\" data-aistatus=\"1\" style=\"height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260728221104_f444d79.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">夸了Opus 5的同时，还不忘捎带手夸波自家的产品。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">看来现在AI圈的竞争真是进入到白热化阶段了，线上不光拼模型，还得拼老板。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">让我们期待接下来各家的表现。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">下一个掀桌子的，会是谁呢？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文报道 A 社发布 Opus 5 模型，该模型在多项 AI 评测榜单中超越 Fable 5 与 GPT-5.6 Sol 且价格仅为后者一半，引发行业震动与马斯克点赞。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文报道 A 社发布 Opus 5 模型，该模型在多项 AI 评测榜单中超越 Fable 5 与 GPT-5.6 Sol 且价格仅为后者一半，引发行业震动与马斯克点赞。",
  "summary": "文章聚焦于 A 社突然发布的 Opus 5 大语言模型。通过 ARC-AGI-3、GDPval-AA、Frontier-Bench 等多维度评测数据，展示 Opus 5 在推理能力、知识工作效能及编程能力上全面领先竞品 Fable 5 与 GPT-5.6 Sol，且性能翻倍。更引人注目的是其定价策略，以半价策略切入市场，直接冲击现有格局。文中引用国外博主用低额度订阅搭建高质量游戏 Demo 的案例，佐证其高性价比与强生产力，甚至被网友戏称为「Fable 6」。此外，马斯克公开推荐 Opus 5，将其与自家 Grok 4.5 并列，凸显了当前 AI 领域激烈的竞争态势。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Opus 5 在多模态与推理榜单上全面超越竞品。",
      "explanation": "在 ARC-AGI-3、GDPval-AA 及 Frontier-Bench 等权威榜单中，Opus 5 均位居榜首，且在编程与多语言任务上表现优异，性能较上一代翻倍。"
    },
    {
      "point": "以半价策略实现性能碾压，重塑市场格局。",
      "explanation": "Opus 5 不仅性能更强，价格却仅为旗舰 Fable 5 的一半，这种「降维打击」迅速引发用户热议与行业震动。"
    },
    {
      "point": "实际应用场景验证其高效生产力。",
      "explanation": "有博主利用极低配额即生成高质量的 Rocket League 克隆版，证明其在跨学科任务（如物理模拟+编程）中的强大整合能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "马斯克背书加剧 AI 巨头竞争白热化。",
      "explanation": "马斯克将 Opus 5 与 Grok 4.5 并列为最优选择，侧面反映 AI 圈已从单纯的技术比拼延伸至生态与品牌影响力的综合较量。"
    }
  ],
